WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.760
This is the end!

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:06.800
D/D/D Marksman King Tell 
attacks Dark Sentinel!

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.420
Forbidden Break Shot!

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.090
It vanished?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.770
Let's battle!  Bloom Diva attacks Wingweaver!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.300
It's finally over!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.770
The winner is Hiiragi!

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:39.000
It was a wonderful duel!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.560
Wait, Serena.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:57.900
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:03.120
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.110
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.310
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.060
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.730
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.530
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:29.650
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:35.120
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:40.720
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.860
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.800
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.130
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:58.410
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.840
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:06.850
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:13.920
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:24.420
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:27.140
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.840
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:32.630
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.380
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:44.940
The Land of Ambition  Duel Academia

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:49.780
I know you're Serena, not Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.480
Yuzu Hiiragi?

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.960
She's someone in this 
world who looks like you.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:03:00.400
But let's ignore for the moment 
why you two look alike.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.390
Before that...

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:02.960
Who are you?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.720
Reiji Akaba.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:08.060
Leo Akaba's son.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.080
You don't remember?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:15.080
I've met you before at Fusion 
Dimension's Academia.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:20.180
You're the duelist that Leo 
Akaba favored the most.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.840
And you're now here in our world.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.760
What's your goal?

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:31.500
Believing in your skills, did Leo Akaba 
send you as the advance guard for invasion?

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.960
Leo Akaba has nothing to do with this!

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:39.920
I came to this world of my own free will, 
not because of someone else's orders.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.670
I remember you.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.960
Three years ago, you traveled through 
dimensions and came to our world.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:55.440
While many of my teammates 
went to the front lines,

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:58.120
I was suffocating in that strict facility.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.590
For three years before you even arrived!

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:31.880
Over there!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:32.760
Catch 'em!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.740
It's the Professor's orders.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.140
Please come back, Serena.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.110
I want to test my power!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.080
The Professor will not permit that.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.550
I don't need permission!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.960
I choose to go outside!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.130
I won't show mercy if you get in my way!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.680
We have no choice.  Seize her.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.920
I summon Lunalight Blue Cat from my hand!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.160
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:31.510
Now bring it on!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:32.710
Do it.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.880
Battle Royal Mode.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.220
I summon Ancient Gear Soldier from my hand!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.140
Go!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:50.330
They have mass without an Action Field?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:57.840
You call yourselves Academia 
teachers with those skills?

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.070
Academia?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.710
Don't get cocky!  It's not over yet!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.710
I summon D/D Cerberus!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.210
Let's battle!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.380
This way!

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:37.680
Let me go!

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.380
You're not from Academia!

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.760
Where's your ship?

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.720
Ship?

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.890
You must have come here on a ship.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.320
I must leave for my future-

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.360
Your future is here.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.340
Father!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:01.500
Serena, I know your power better than anyone.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.980
Then why are you locking 
me up on this island?

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.210
Why won't you use my power?

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.840
Because it's not yet time.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.370
Then when?

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:13.160
When it's time to destroy Xyz?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.680
Or Synchro?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.240
Xyz?  Synchro?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.080
Destroy them?

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:25.060
Everyone is gossiping that we're 
about to invade Xyz Dimension.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:29.530
If you believe in my power, 
then now's the time to use it!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.500
Add me to the troops!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.230
Let me join the advance guard!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.760
I can't allow that.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.880
Why not?

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.470
There is something you must do.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.820
Wait!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.940
Invading and destroying...  
What are you talking about?

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:46.310
What is this place?  What's Academia?

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.280
You left me, Mother and our 
company without saying anything!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:53.520
What are you doing, Father?

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:57.680
So you traveled through 
dimensions to find the answer.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.800
Dimensions?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.720
What?

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.160
What are you doing?

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.560
Stop it!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.370
Let me go!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:13.610
Serena, even if you escape, I'll find you.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.840
And I will bring you back.  That's a promise.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.780
Take her away.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.240
Let me go!  Stop it!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.760
I want to be free!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.020
You go home too.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.040
Talk to me first!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.260
Tell me where I am!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.840
This is the Fusion Dimension.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:39.720
Academia is my frontline 
base to accomplish my plan.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.600
What's your plan?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.850
You will eventually find out.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.000
Put it on.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.800
What are you doing?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.400
It's set.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:56.900
What is this?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:09:02.440
It's a miniature version of the 
interdimensional transporter that you used.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:05.190
We closed the gate that you traveled through.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.160
When you arrive in your dimension, 
it will self-destruct.

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:11.660
You can no longer come back here.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.760
Just stay in the other world!

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.640
We're not done talking!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.760
What do you mean by invade and destroy?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.380
It's to unite all the worlds into one.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:28.910
Worlds into one?  What do you mean, Father?

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.240
Father!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:39.560
I've been preparing for three years 
to stop Leo Akaba's ambitions.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:44.360
That's why I took his place as 
President of Leo Corporation.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:49.330
I've discovered talented duelists 
and worked hard to train them.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:54.480
Everything I do is to protect 
this city, to protect our home.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.040
Will you team up with me?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.200
Team up?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.320
Yes.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:03.440
Let's protect this world from 
Leo Akaba and Academia together.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:04.600
That's stupid.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:09.320
I'm here because I heard 
that Xyz survivors are here.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:14.320
I'll defeat those Xyz this time 
until there are none left!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:19.250
Defeating an invader from Academia 
requires exceptional skill.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:23.700
So if I defeat them, Leo Akaba 
will have to believe in my power.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:27.720
But my first target didn't 
meet my expectations.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.120
He must not be one of them.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:37.250
Your recent target, Yu Sakuragi, 
isn't one of them either.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.720
Where are they?

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:43.700
Where are the Xyz Dimension duelists with 
the skills to defeat Academia invaders?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.400
It's over!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:51.200
The winner is LDS's Syun Kurosaki!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.820
Knight of Duels's Shalulu received 
special entry from overseas,

00:10:55.820 --> 00:11:01.140
but he could do nothing against 
Kurosaki for a one-sided defeat!

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:04.040
Duelists from Xyz Dimension?

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:05.840
I know nothing.

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.720
Then I'll find them on my own.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:14.440
If you're planning to cause mayhem in 
the city, I can't turn a blind eye.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:19.440
Even if Leo Akaba didn't 
order you to come here,

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:22.560
I'll consider you an enemy 
if you don't team up with me.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.600
I won't let you.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:33.510
I've informed Academia 
of our current location.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.210
He was forced to go home.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.800
Forced to go home?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:46.320
Hunting parties from Academia will arrive 
in great numbers to bring me back.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.050
Just like you saw three years ago.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:55.490
Serena, even if you escape, I'll find you.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.700
And I will bring you back.  That's a promise.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.880
If that happens, it'll 
be much more than mayhem.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:06.710
But I won't be captured.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:11.310
I'll defeat the hunting parties, and 
if I also defeat the Xyz duelists,

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:15.200
Leo Akaba will have to believe in my power.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.080
It's me.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:25.740
Assemble the staff immediately.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.640
Now for duel news.

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:36.240
Fierce battles took place 
at the Maiami Championship.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:40.760
In the Junior Youth Class, the second 
round matches have completed today,

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.840
and the best 16 duelists are left.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.240
Here's the lineup.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.160
Here she comes!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.820
First is Yuzu Hiiragi from You Show School.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.640
There she is!  So cute!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.260
My daughter is the best!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.330
I'm fired up!  My blood is boiling!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:09.880
Also from You Show School is the duelist 
known for his entertainment dueling.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.810
He made his name with Pendulum 
Summoning, Yuya Sakaki!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.530
He defeated two strong competitors:

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:22.880
LDS's Shingo Sawatari in the first round and 
Ryozanpaku School's Isao Kachidoki in the second round.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:26.680
He has advanced to the 3rd round 
in his first-ever apperance.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.720
I'll never duel like I did 
against Kachidoki again.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:36.840
Like I did with Sawatari, I'm going to 
duel in a way that makes the crowd happy.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.800
We're rivals now.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.740
As representatives of You Show School,

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.920
let's reach the top with the 
best entertainment dueling.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.810
Yeah!  Yuzu, your second 
round duel was really good.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.880
I'll try hard to duel like that again.

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.280
I'll do the best entertainment dueling!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.190
This is what being young is all about!

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:09.500
Being young and dueling!  Aim for the top!

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.830
You're so loud, Principal.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.800
They're still introducing 
the other competitors.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:19.100
Following the three members of the 
international team Knight of Duels,

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.780
it's Kirigakure Cooking 
School's Michio Mokota!

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.360
It's Michy!

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.540
He's wonderful!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:27.980
Yoko...

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.680
Mom, why are you here?

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.960
Teppei Tairyobata is a fishing duelist.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.690
His favorite phrase is 
“netting a big haul."

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.060
I hope he catches a big one.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:45.160
Next is Noboru Gongenzaka of Gongenzaka Dojo.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:50.040
By honing his Immovable Duel, he's 
one of the favorites to win it all.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:57.910
Along with Gongenzaka, another tournament 
favorite is LDS's Syun Kurosaki.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.440
Kurosaki!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:04.800
I still remember his astonishing duel 
in the first round when he defeated

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.140
You Show School's Sora Shiunin.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:11.260
Kurosaki also won his second round 
match in a one-sided battle.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:15.400
What kind of dueling will he 
show us in the third round?

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:18.960
What kind?  Anyone can 
see that he goes too far!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.920
It's probably his fault 
that Sora has disappeared.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.270
It's so frustrating that it gives me shivers!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:25.840
Sora...

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:30.910
I've heard that you want 
to go to Standard again.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:35.400
Yes!  There are Xyz refugees in Standard!

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.420
I'll grant your wish.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.390
Thank you!

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:44.040
But you won't be acting alone this time.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.090
You'll go with them.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.930
Obelisk Force?

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:55.120
Hunting the Xyz refugees 
is your secondary mission.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.640
Your primary mission is this girl.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.280
Yuzu?

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:03.360
No, she's Serena.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.440
Serena?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:08.720
But she looks exactly like Yuzu.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.000
Why?

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.250
You don't need to know.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:19.240
Your mission is to find Serena 
and bring her back to this world.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:22.540
If you must battle duelists in 
their world to bring her back,

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.400
then I grant you permission to do so.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.730
You must bring Serena back!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:34.160
Don't worry.  Sora will definitely come back.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.910
Definitely!  That's what I believe!

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:38.820
Dad!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.380
Principal!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:45.400
If you try hard to win the 
championship, Sora will notice!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:49.090
He'll come back because he'll realize 
that he needs to try harder too!

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.540
You're right.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:57.060
He only entered the Junior Youth 
Tournament because Yuya entered.

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:00.400
If you two keep winning, he'll 
get frustrated and show up.

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.540
And Tatsuya is still in 
the Junior Championship.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.560
That's right!

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.800
Yuya, Yuzu and Tatsuya, I want 
you to make Sora frustrated!

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:12.360
And go for the championship!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:17.360
But I want Michy to win it all too.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.240
Mom...

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:24.240
The battle to determine the best 
8 duelists begins tomorrow!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:29.320
I hope they fight hard so that 
they have no regrets later!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.240
Now for tomorrow's weather-

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.020
It's finally starting.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:36.280
No, I won't let it start.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:41.040
I promise to stop the enemy 
from invading this city.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.570
Kurosaki isn't here.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:07.600
Where did he go?

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:14.770
Everyone, thanks for waiting!

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:22.310
Junior Youth Class's 16 heroes will 
participate in a battle royal!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:33.200
Battle royal?

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:38.550
Having a battle royal in the 
city is a good idea, Reiji.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:43.880
If we announce that there are 
invaders from another dimension,

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.940
it'll cause a panic throughout the city.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.750
By sending the Junior Youth's 
remaining 16 duelists into the city,

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.040
they'll strike the enemy 
during the battle royal.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:57.150
These eight duelists will counterattack them.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.710
The Youth Class's best 8 are highly skilled.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:05.200
Since they're all from LDS, it's 
easier to carry out this plan.

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:11.330
For LDS's honor, we're counting 
on you to protect our world.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.340
Right!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:22.010
Kurosaki, among the 15 
duelists at the stadium,

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:27.850
your mission is to determine which are 
worthy of joining my Lancers team.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.480
You're telling me not to fight the enemy.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.310
I can't promise that.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:36.320
If those eight are defeated, 
I'll be required to fight.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:39.020
You're only Junior Youth!  
Stop being arrogant!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:42.530
Try hard to survive.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.710
I'll explain the rules!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.870
It begins exactly at noon!

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.420
At that moment, Action 
Cards will be dispersed.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.330
Now here's the important part!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:20:00.710
Pendulum Cards created by Leo Corporation 
are hidden throughout the city!

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:01.910
What?

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:04.000
The contestants must go into the city

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:07.890
and find at least two Pendulum 
Cards before they can duel!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.360
Everyone needs Pendulum Cards?

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:14.570
That means everyone can Pendulum Summon.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:19.600
Under the ante rule, they'll wager 
their Pendulum Cards in their matches.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:23.360
After deciding how many 
Pendulum Cards to wager,

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.910
the winner gets the loser's Pendulum Cards.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.080
The time limit is 24 hours.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:35.060
The Field Spell Quartet of Quandry will 
activate, diving the city into four areas.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:39.020
The contestants can battle in any area.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.420
The city is an Action Field?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.570
And four areas!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.320
I'm getting shivers!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.290
It's almost time to begin!

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:51.660
Contestants, ready your Duel Disks!

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.420
Battle Royal Mode.

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.180
Open the gate!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:36.900
The Xyz refugees are in there.

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:40.260
Let's begin.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:43.600
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:48.880
Along with their monsters, they'll kick the ground 
and fly through the sky to move around the field!

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:52.390
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:54.390
Action!

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:55.630
Duel!

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:35.740
As long as there's a smile

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:42.520
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:47.820
I always believe

00:22:47.990 --> 00:22:51.340
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:56.970
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:05.610
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:12.480
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:19.150
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:23.220
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.820
The Field Spell Quartet of Quandry 
appears throughout the city.

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:59.280
The battle for Pendulum 
Cards is about to begin!

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:02.930
Duelists are ready to battle and win!

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:08.620
Ryozanpaku School's duelists with 
sinister smiles are after me!

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:11.910
What?  A two-on-one duel?

00:24:12.580 --> 00:24:16.750
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Battle Royal Begins

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:19.120
The fun is only getting started!
